# @kulala-vscode-restclient-compat
### Health Test
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Register User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"username":"{{username}}",
	"password":"{{password}}",
	"email":"{{email}}"
}

### Login User
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"email":"{{email}}",
	"password":"{{password}}"
}


### Show Public Monitor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/monitors/1/status

### Create Monitor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitors
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"url":"https://battleship-clone.xyz/api/v1/health",
	"check_interval":60,
	"webhook_url":"https://discord.com/api/webhooks/1525399984948777131/_1Q5PX0wb6O9BIXSONyqLG02f_rogfrXlZMp6TNOXZuJjblN0w2Dk_HbG0xUg7lXQIx1",
	"is_public":true
}




